ary Gygax\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Gary Gygax co-created Dungeons &amp; Dragons.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Created By\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/dungeons-and-dragons/dave-arneson\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Dave Arneson\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Dave Arneson co-created Dungeons &amp; Dragons.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </details>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"topic-section\">\n    <details>\n        <summary class=\"topic-summary\">\n            <span class=\"topic-title\">Published By</span>\n            <span class=\"topic-count\">1</span>\n        </summary>\n\n        \n\n        <div class=\"topic-content\">\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Published By\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/dungeons-and-dragons/hasbro/wizards-of-the-coast\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Wizards of the Coast\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Wizards of the Coast publishes D&amp;D.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </details>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"topic-section\">\n    <details>\n        <summary class=\"topic-summary\">\n            <span class=\"topic-title\">Related To</span>\n            <span class=\"topic-count\">1</span>\n        </summary>\n\n        \n\n        <div class=\"topic-content\">\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Related To\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/dungeons-and-dragons/vecna\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Vecna\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Vecna&#039;s artifacts appear across D&amp;D settings.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </details>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"topic-section\">\n    <details>\n        <summary class=\"topic-summary\">\n            <span class=\"topic-title\">Connected To</span>\n            <span class=\"topic-count\">1</span>\n        </summary>\n\n        \n\n        <div class=\"topic-content\">\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Connected To\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/dungeons-and-dragons/hasbro\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Hasbro\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Hasbro is connected to Dungeons &amp; Dragons through shared lore.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </details>\n</section>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"did-you-know\">\n    <h2>Did you know?</h2>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Dungeons &amp; Dragons is also referenced as D&amp;D, DnD, Dungeons and Dragons.</li><li>Gary Gygax co-created Dungeons &amp; Dragons.</li><li>5e is the current D&amp;D edition.</li><li>Wizards of the Coast publishes D&amp;D.</li><li>Dave Arneson co-created Dungeons &amp; Dragons.</li><li>Evidence around Dungeons &amp; Dragons is classified as fiction on Ton-o-Lore.</li>\n    </ul>\n</section>","overview":"<section class=\"overview\">\n    <h2>What is Dungeons &amp; Dragons?</h2>\n    \n    <p>\n        Dungeons &amp; Dragons is the tabletop role-playing game published by <a href=\"/dungeons-and-dragons/hasbro/wizards-of-the-coast\" class=\"entity-link\">Wizards of the Coast</a>, spanning editions from <a href=